{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "vector": "event-envelope.phone",
  "source": {
    "checkout": "bf4075b0a2e8092b04b726c59a7b085d5a37e6f6"
  },
  "upstream": [
    "event-envelope.json"
  ],
  "delta": [
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable event type: agent.comm. The envelope shape is unchanged.",
    "agent.comm is written with local origin comm-service; team-tools is not a registered local source.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable event type: redaction.applied. It records rule names and counts for one redacted tool result and never the original text.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable event type: erasure. The envelope is unchanged; its data is frozen by erasure-event.schema.json and names the payloads the host physically cleared.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive principal kind: maintainer. Maintenance batches write memory.maintenance_started / memory.maintenance_finished / memory.maintenance_rolled_back and every document write carries correlationId memory-maintenance:<batch>.",
    "CCR-1: principal.botId/sessionId, causationId and correlationId are absent in iOS bytes and explicit null in the upstream golden; both decode identically and both validate.",
    "CCR-1: event-envelope.schema.json is durable-only; ephemeral events use event-envelope.ephemeral.schema.json, carry no commitSeq and are never stored.",
    "CCR-2: authz.grant_snapshot is a durable type whose data is frozen by authz-grant-snapshot.schema.json; the vector is produced by the Swift BotGrantSnapshot encoder.",
    "memory.document_written and memory.document_deleted are phoneDSH durable memory-document types already present in BotEventEnvelopeCodec.durableEventTypes; the enum repair records them. Their data shapes are owned by the bot/v2 memory document contract, not by this envelope.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable event type: feedback.recorded. It is written with ignorable:true, origin.kind=local source=card-bridge (UI) or mcp (chat tool), principal.kind=chat; no origin/principal enum value is added. Its data is frozen by spec/bot/v2/feedback.schema.json and the G-2 contract. Unknown-type readers ignore it.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable types: context.observed / context.consent_changed. Both are written with ignorable:true, origin.kind=local source=runtime and principal.kind=proactive; no origin/principal enum value is added. Their data is frozen by spec/bot/v2/context-observation.schema.json and spec/bot/v2/context-sources.md.",
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable type: skill.changed. Written with ignorable:true, origin.kind=local source=user and principal.kind=chat; data is frozen by spec/bot/v2/skill-change.schema.json. Old readers ignore it; skill lineage is host-global."
  ],
